 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Cloud9 API (2017-09-23). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. EC2 environments are stored metadata: no EC2 instance, AMI, security group or IDE is launched, connected or stopped, so instanceType, imageId, subnetId and automaticStopTimeMinutes are validated and accepted but not used, as AWS never returns them. ownerArn is required because the simulator does not resolve the calling identity's ARN; clientRequestToken, dryRun and managed credentials actions are refused, and only the documented Amazon Linux 2, Amazon Linux 2023 and Ubuntu 22.04 images are accepted. Environment status and environment memberships return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501.",
  "title": "AWS Cloud9 (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2017-09-23"
 },
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
